#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# weierstrass_invariant_g3

#% text
# `weierstrass_invariant_g3([omega1, omega3])` gives the invariant `g3` of the lattice with half-periods `omega1`, `omega3`.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# The second part of `weierstrass_invariants([omega1, omega3])`.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
weierstrass_invariant_g3([1.0, 2.0*im])
#% output
#= 4.44305204494595

#% cell
n(weierstrass_invariant_g3([1, 2*im]), 30)
#% output
#= 4.4430520449459499906285496780843793

#% cell
weierstrass_invariant_g3([1, exp(im*pi/3)])
#% output
#= gamma(1/3)^18/(4096*pi^6)

